 about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le09ob10re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking About a Life Event"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Events that happen in your life are called life events. Life events are important to remember.<br> You use nouns and expressions like <span class=\"italic\">life-changing</span> or<span class=\"italic\"> Did you know that</span> \u2026 ? to describe key life events.<br> You use an expression like <span class=\"italic\">someday</span> to talk about a life event in the future. You cannot be sure about it."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Event\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Expressions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"first day of school/work<br> birthday<br> graduation<br> getting a job<br> promotion<br> wedding<br> having a baby<br> anniversary (10th/25th)<br> retiring<br>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"memorable<br> eventful<br> life-changing<br> Did you know that \u2026 ?<br> I/it was so \u2026<br> When was the last time \u2026 ?<br> someday\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "The challenge was memorable."}, {"type": "example", "content": "It was a life-changing experience."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Did you know that it was the first time I ever capsized a boat?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "The race was so eventful!"}, {"type": "example", "content": "One for the history books! "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'm going to get a promotion someday!"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "One for the history books! "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "something you remember all your life "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The race was so fun! One for the history books!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le09ob10aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about a life event."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "life-changing "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "very important; an event that changes your life"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: The River Challenge was a life-changing experience."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le09ob10aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "scared "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "afraid "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I was scared when the boat capsized."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le09ob10aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "eventful"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "exciting; something that keeps you busy "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The race was eventful. So many things happened!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le09ob10aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "memorable"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "something you remember for a long time "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The trip was memorable!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le09ob10aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to bond "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to become very close to someone "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The tour group bonded during the race."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le09ob10aud06"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Think of 3 events that are very important in your life."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 2-3 sentences for each event."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Tell your partner about them."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Listen to your partner talk about his or her key life events."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write 6-9 lines about three key events in my life."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about my key life events."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I ask questions about someone else's life."}]}], "type": "sena"}